-- src:2803 | (4) No payment shall be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund under this section in excess of the total of
-- src:2804 | (a) the amount of the balance to the credit of the Canada Pension Plan Account, and
-- src:2805 | (b) the fair market value of the assets of the Investment Board less its liabilities, in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan.
