      `the fair market value of the assets of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan` IS A NUMBER
      `the liabilities of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 108(4) — a payment may be made out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund under section 108` payment `the balance to the credit of the Canada Pension Plan Account` `the fair market value of the assets of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan` `the liabilities of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan` MEANS
    payment AT MOST (`s 108(4) — the most that may be paid out of the Consolidated Revenue Fund under section 108` `the balance to the credit of the Canada Pension Plan Account` `the fair market value of the assets of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan` `the liabilities of the Investment Board in relation to the base Canada Pension Plan`)

