§§ `Sections 108.1 and 108.3 -- management of the accounts`

-- "Any amounts standing to the credit of the Canada Pension Plan Account that exceed the immediate obligations of that Account
-- shall be transferred to the Investment Board, unless any agreement entered into under section 111.1 provides otherwise."
-- NOTHING: an agreement under section 111.1 provides otherwise and its terms are not read here.
