      `the amount required by subsection 21(2) to be paid by Her Majesty for failing to deduct and remit the contributions required to be made under subsections 8(1.1) and (1.2) by those persons` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 118(1.1) — the amount charged to the Consolidated Revenue Fund and credited to the Additional Canada Pension Plan Account` `the contributions required to be made by Her Majesty in right of Canada under subsections 9(1.1) and (1.2) in respect of persons in employment under Her Majesty that is not excepted employment` `the amount required by subsection 21(2) to be paid by Her Majesty for failing to deduct and remit the contributions required to be made under subsections 8(1.1) and (1.2) by those persons` MEANS
    (`the contributions required to be made by Her Majesty in right of Canada under subsections 9(1.1) and (1.2) in respect of persons in employment under Her Majesty that is not excepted employment`)
