-- src:3095 | Contributions under agreement
-- src:3096 | (2) There shall be charged to the Consolidated Revenue Fund and paid to the appropriate authority in a province with which an agreement has been entered into under subsection 4(3) an amount equal to
-- src:3097 | (a) the contributions required to be paid by Her Majesty in right of Canada under that agreement as employer’s contributions, and
