      `the amount required to be paid by Her Majesty for failing to deduct and remit the employee's contributions in accordance with the agreement` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`s 118(2) — the amount charged to the Consolidated Revenue Fund and paid to the appropriate authority in the province` `the contributions required to be paid by Her Majesty in right of Canada under the agreement as employer's contributions` `the amount required to be paid by Her Majesty for failing to deduct and remit the employee's contributions in accordance with the agreement` MEANS
